		<author><name><![CDATA[VK3KYY]]></name></author>
		<updated>2023-11-19T21:53:00</updated>

		<published>2023-11-19T21:53:00</published>
		<id>http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3496&amp;p=27537#p27537</id>
		<link href="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3496&amp;p=27537#p27537"/>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[New Beta 2023 11 19]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=3496&amp;p=27537#p27537"><![CDATA[
A new Beta is available for the GD77/DM1801/RD5R/RD77S<br><br>See<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest</a><br><br><br>Changes since the last Beta release are<br><br>Firmware:<ul><li> VOX bugfixes.</li><li> Don't trigger the vox when VP is playing.</li><li> Various languages updates.</li><li> GPS support added on all platforms except the GD-77S and RD5R.</li><li> GPS NMEA logging added (optional). GD-77S and RD5R are excluded here. <ul> <li> NMEA log clearing at boot time (SK1 + 5).</li> <li> using Logging on &lt; 16Mb devices disable the DMDId feature (cleared).</li> </ul></li><li> APRS beaconing added (Channel/VFO/Satellite). <ul> <li> please refer to the user guide for details.</li> </ul></li><li> Satellite: Voice/APRS/CW Rx modes added..</li><li> Show/Sort distance to repeater feature added.</li><li> VP updated.</li><li> Fix menu system bug (cancelation/validation on Options ones).</li><li> Fix problems with CPS communication when the GPS NMEA output is enabled.</li><li> Fix a CWID bug in the hotspot mode.</li><li> Adds Auto Lock options (see the user guide).</li><li> Various bugfixes.</li></ul><br>This version features the APRS beacon functionality described in this post  <a href="https://www.opengd77.com/viewtopic.php?f=16&amp;t=3352&amp;start=10#p26717" class="postlink">viewtopic.php?f=16&amp;t=3352&amp;start=10#p26717</a>  <br><br>Thanks to Daniel F1RMB for the majority of these new features and bug fixes and to Colin G4EML for the fix to the 1750Hz tone generation improvement.<br><br>The User Guide will be fully updated to document all the new features soon.<br><br><br>Note. <br><br>Existing voice prompt files do not work with this version. The latest new versions can be downloaded from here<br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/Voice_Prompts/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/Voice_Prompts/Latest</a><br><br>Also the functionality to read and write the calibration data requires the latest CPS, which can be downloaded from here<br><br><a href="https://www.opengd77.com/downloads/PC_CPS/Latest" class="postlink">downloads/PC_CPS/Latest</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Sun Nov 19, 2023 9:53 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
